message: "For Paper 2, cite the article below and the v2.0.0 release. Paper 1 metadata is frozen at v1.0.2."
title: "Institutional Representation Research: Paper 2 code and frozen evidence"
abstract: >-
  Code and frozen model outputs for Who May Overrule the Agent? Evidence-Gated
  Authority in LLM Review Institutions. Compares broad reviewer override with
  evidence-gated authority across Qwen3-8B and Mistral-Small-24B, spatial-policy
  and portfolio-transfer tasks, and a prospective retain/replace/escalate
  validation. Based on submission commit 63cbef41; excludes later Paper 3 work.
